WEBVTT

00:09:26.729 --> 00:09:30.190
as your generation had to be
during the civil rights era?"

00:09:31.066 --> 00:09:33.777
He couldn't speak very well
because of Parkinson's.

00:09:34.111 --> 00:09:36.864
So I had to get close, and he whispered,

00:09:36.864 --> 00:09:38.741
"I have a confession to make."

00:09:38.782 --> 00:09:40.117
"What is it?" I said.

00:09:40.159 --> 00:09:42.995
He said, "I wasn't as great
as I said I was."

00:09:42.995 --> 00:09:44.204
(Laughter)

00:09:44.246 --> 00:09:45.831
"Holy shit," I said.

00:09:45.873 --> 00:09:47.374
(Laughter)

00:09:47.374 --> 00:09:50.002
"That's the biggest confession
I ever heard in my life.

00:09:50.002 --> 00:09:52.630
The whole world knows
you as Ali, the greatest."

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.007
And then he said,

00:09:55.049 --> 00:09:57.301
"I think you misunderstand me.

00:09:58.302 --> 00:10:00.512
I'll tell you what was great," he said.